{"text":"kuruntokai","n":71,"lines":["மருந்தெனின் மருந்தே வைப்பெனின் வைப்பே","அரும்பிய சுணங்கின் அம்பகட் டிளமுலைப்","பெருந்தோள் நுணுகிய நுசுப்பிற்","கல்கெழு கானவர் நல்குறு மகளே"],"tr":["marunteṉiṉ maruntē vaippeṉiṉ vaippē","arumpiya cuṇaṅkiṉ ampakaṭ ṭiḷamulaip","peruntōḷ nuṇukiya nucuppiṟ","kalkeḻu kāṉavar nalkuṟu makaḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"கருவூர் ஓதஞானியார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Karuvūr Ōtañāṉiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மருந்தெனின்","tr":"marunteṉiṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருந்","tr":"marun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெனின்","tr":"teṉiṉ"}]},{"text":"மருந்தே","tr":"maruntē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருந்","tr":"marun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]},{"text":"வைப்பெனின்","tr":"vaippeṉiṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வைப்","tr":"vaip"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெனின்","tr":"peṉiṉ"}]},{"text":"வைப்பே","tr":"vaippē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வைப்","tr":"vaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]}],[{"text":"அரும்பிய","tr":"arumpiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரும்","tr":"arum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிய","tr":"piya"}]},{"text":"சுணங்கின்","tr":"cuṇaṅkiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுணங்","tr":"cuṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"}]},{"text":"அம்பகட்","tr":"ampakaṭ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பகட்","tr":"pakaṭ"}]},{"text":"டிளமுலைப்","tr":"ṭiḷamulaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிள","tr":"ṭiḷa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முலைப்","tr":"mulaip"}]}],[{"text":"பெருந்தோள்","tr":"peruntōḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோள்","tr":"tōḷ"}]},{"text":"நுணுகிய","tr":"nuṇukiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுணு","tr":"nuṇu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"நுசுப்பிற்","tr":"nucuppiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுசுப்","tr":"nucup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]}],[{"text":"கல்கெழு","tr":"kalkeḻu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெழு","tr":"keḻu"}]},{"text":"கானவர்","tr":"kāṉavar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னவர்","tr":"ṉavar"}]},{"text":"நல்குறு","tr":"nalkuṟu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறு","tr":"kuṟu"}]},{"text":"மகளே","tr":"makaḷē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மருந்து","parts":[{"text":"மருந்து","lemma":"maruntu","gloss":"medicine"}],"gloss":"medicine"},{"surface":"எனின்","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"eṉiṉ","gloss":"if one says"}],"gloss":"if one says"},{"surface":"மருந்தே","parts":[{"text":"மருந்து","lemma":"maruntu","gloss":"medicine"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed medicine"},{"surface":"வைப்பு","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"vaippu","gloss":"treasure"}],"gloss":"treasure"},{"surface":"எனின்","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"eṉiṉ","gloss":"if one says"}],"gloss":"if one says"},{"surface":"வைப்பே","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"vaippu","gloss":"treasure"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed treasure"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரும்பிய","parts":[{"text":"அரும்பு","lemma":"arumpu","gloss":"bud"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"budded"},{"surface":"சுணங்கின்","parts":[{"text":"சுணங்கு","lemma":"cuṇaṅku","gloss":"beauty-spots"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the beauty-spots"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"பகட்டு","parts":[{"text":"பகட்டு","lemma":"பகட்டு","gloss":"of greatness"}],"gloss":"of greatness","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இள","parts":[{"text":"இள","lemma":"iḷa","gloss":"young"}],"gloss":"young"},{"surface":"முலை","parts":[{"text":"முலை","lemma":"mulai","gloss":"breast"}],"gloss":"breast"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"large"},{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulder"}],"gloss":"large shoulders"},{"surface":"நுணுகிய","parts":[{"text":"நுணுகு","lemma":"nuṇuku","gloss":"become slender"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"slendered"},{"surface":"நுசுப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"நுசுப்பு","lemma":"nusuppu","gloss":"waist"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the waist"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கல்","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"kal","gloss":"rock"}],"gloss":"rocky"},{"surface":"கெழு","parts":[{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"abounding in"},{"surface":"கானவர்","parts":[{"text":"கானவர்","lemma":"kāṉavar","gloss":"forest-dwellers"}],"gloss":"forest-dwellers"},{"surface":"நல்குறு","parts":[{"text":"நல்கு","lemma":"nalku","gloss":"poverty"},{"text":"உறு","lemma":"uṟu","gloss":"experience"}],"gloss":"poor"},{"surface":"மகளே","parts":[{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"makaḷ","gloss":"daughter"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"O"}],"gloss":"O daughter!"}]}],"literal":"If medicine, she is medicine; if treasure, she is treasure / having sprouted beauty-spots, beautiful, lofty, young breasts, / large shoulders, and a slender waist, / the daughter of the forest-dwellers of the rocky mountains.","translation":"If she is medicine, she is indeed medicine. If she is a treasure, she is indeed a treasure—the simple daughter of the forest-dwellers of the rocky mountains, who has large shoulders, a slender waist, and beautiful, lofty, young breasts covered with newly sprouted beauty-spots.","modern":"மலைகள் நிறைந்த காட்டில் வாழும் வேடர்களின் எளிய மகளான அவள், உடம்பில் அரும்பிய தேமலும், அழகிய பருத்த இளமையான மார்பகங்களும், பெரிய தோள்களும், மெல்லிய இடையும் கொண்டவள். நோய் தீர்க்கும் மருந்து என்று சொன்னால் அவள் மருந்தாவாள்; சேமித்து வைத்த செல்வம் என்று சொன்னால் அவள் செல்வமாவாள்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero in the Pālai (wasteland) landscape, expressing his deep love and admiration for the heroine. He describes her as the simple daughter of the mountain forest-dwellers (kāṉavar) who live among the rocks. He praises her physical beauty, noting her large shoulders (peruntōḷ), slender waist (nusuppu), and young breasts adorned with newly sprouted beauty-spots (cuṇaṅku). To him, she is both a healing medicine (maruntu) for his love-sickness and a precious treasure (vaippu) to be guarded. The contrast between her humble forest origin and her immense value to the hero highlights the intensity of his devotion.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}